And just call me Billy.

538
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:11,970
才不干呢
Not doin' it.

539
00:19:15,738 --> 00:19:19,736
这是那边一桌的先生们送的
And these are from the gentlemen at that table over there.

540
00:19:19,736 --> 00:19:22,025
免费酒水 免费酒水又来了
Oh, free drinks. More free drinks.

541
00:19:22,025 --> 00:19:23,714
谢谢 谢...他们听不到
Thank you. Thank--they can't hear me.

542
00:19:23,714 --> 00:19:24,973
谢谢
Thank you!

543
00:19:25,873 --> 00:19:27,792
这肯定就是模特的感觉
This is what models must feel like.

544
00:19:27,792 --> 00:19:30,410
打扰下 有没有人跟你说过
Excuse me, but has anyone ever told you

545
00:19:30,410 --> 00:19:32,509
你就是年轻版的范·强森[演员]
you look like a young Van Johnson?

546
00:19:32,519 --> 00:19:34,199
没人说过 不过你真会说话
Oh, no. That-- that's so sweet, though.

547
00:19:34,208 --> 00:19:35,318
多谢
Thank you.

548
00:19:35,318 --> 00:19:36,727
他给你"免费入场券"呢
Free pass?

549
00:19:36,727 --> 00:19:37,797
在你手机上找出范·强森的照片
Pull up Van Johnson on your phone.

550
00:19:37,797 --> 00:19:39,196
我需要知道是该欢喜还是该担忧
I need to know how I feel about that.

551
00:19:39,196 --> 00:19:40,835
他可帅了 你就高兴吧
He was gorgeous. You're fine.

552
00:19:40,845 --> 00:19:43,554
这样可真爽 被人夸 有人请喝酒
This is nice, huh? Compliments, free drinks.

553
00:19:43,554 --> 00:19:44,913
还有什么比这更爽的
What could be better?

554
00:19:45,433 --> 00:19:48,042
好了 先生们 差不多午夜了
Alright gentlemen! Almost midnight!

555
00:19:48,042 --> 00:19:49,271
嘴巴嘟起来吧
Pucker up.

556
00:19:49,811 --> 00:19:51,470
新年真奇怪
New Year's is so weird,

557
00:19:51,470 --> 00:19:52,849
会让你想到时光流逝
the way it makes you think about time.

558
00:19:52,849 --> 00:19:54,868
十 九 八
Ten... Nine... Eight...

559
00:19:54,868 --> 00:19:56,218
小卡
Cam.

560
00:19:56,218 --> 00:19:56,757
我想正是这样
I think that's why

561
00:19:56,757 --> 00:19:59,336
人们才给自己巨大压力 要在新年玩得开心
people put so much pressure on themselves to have fun.

562
00:19:59,336 --> 00:20:02,145
七 六 五
seven... six... five...

563
00:20:02,145 --> 00:20:04,044
我想我大概明白了
I mean, I guess I sorta get it.

564
00:20:04,044 --> 00:20:08,192
四 三 二 一
four... three... two... one!

565
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:14,478
快点 许愿吧
Quick, quick! Make your wishes!

566
00:20:14,478 --> 00:20:16,957
就像现在 我只希望能让时间放慢脚步
Like right now I wish I could just slow down time,

567
00:20:17,577 --> 00:20:20,086
因为我完全没有准备好他长大成人
'cause I am so not ready for him to grow up yet.

568
00:20:21,905 --> 00:20:22,744
我懂
I know.

569
00:20:23,404 --> 00:20:25,673
我希望他永远是我们的笨弟弟
I want him to stay our stupid little brother.

570
00:20:27,762 --> 00:20:29,071
新年快乐
Hey, happy new year.

571
00:20:29,081 --> 00:20:29,951
你也快乐
You too.

572
00:20:32,210 --> 00:20:33,419
我的天 这里面放了什么
Oh, my god, what is in this?

573
00:20:33,429 --> 00:20:35,208
抱歉 那杯是我的
Oh. Sorry. That one's mine.

574
00:20:39,986 --> 00:20:42,335
我发誓 我太紧张了
And I swear to you, I was so nervous,

575
00:20:42,335 --> 00:20:44,394
我想我穿上了别人的内裤
I think I might have put on somebody else's underwear.

576
00:20:44,394 --> 00:20:45,313
我是说真的
I'm not kidding.

577
00:20:45,313 --> 00:20:46,663
我爱死这故事了
I love this story.

578
00:20:46,663 --> 00:20:49,211
-几乎和你的一样棒 范·强森 -妈呀
- Almost as good as yours, Van Johnson. - Oh, my god!

579
00:20:49,211 --> 00:20:50,041
看 杰来了
Oh, look. Here comes Jay.

580
00:20:50,041 --> 00:20:52,050
我好内疚 他错过了所有的精彩
I feel bad he missed all this fun.

581
00:20:52,050 --> 00:20:54,399
-爸 -瞧他们回来了 我忠诚的家人
- Hi, dad. - Look, they're back. My devoted family.

582
00:20:54,399 --> 00:20:56,638
各位 这是我们亲爱的朋友 比利·迪·威廉姆斯
Everyone, this is our dear friend, Billy Dee Williams.

583
00:20:58,317 --> 00:21:00,216
天啊 《星球大战》里的蓝多
Oh, my god, it's Lando.

584
00:21:00,606 --> 00:21:02,205
恕我冒昧 威廉姆斯先生
Excuse me, Mr. Williams,

585
00:21:02,205 --> 00:21:02,934
我得告诉你
I just have to tell you,

586
00:21:02,934 --> 00:21:04,963
我从小就好爱你
I've loved you since I was a little boy.

587
00:21:05,503 --> 00:21:07,422
我现在真是"求星大战"
I'm so Starstruck right now.

588
00:21:07,422 --> 00:21:09,321
你一定是米奇尔吧
Well, you must be Mitchell.

589
00:21:09,331 --> 00:21:11,600
你的事杰都告诉我了
Jay told me all about you.
